      "id": "survey-selected-model",
      "subject": "DAMIT 321: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-321.txt. Model 321, version 2011-04-21, pole (359°, 30°), period 35.251 h match the retained metadata. The archive diameter field is 85 ±9 km; its applicability to our scale is a separate calibration decision. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
